[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0010","text":"──这场演出成功了的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0020","text":"…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0030","text":"……我们\n能更进一步的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0040","text":"大概就能有更大的舞台\n也能去更多的地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0050","text":"……好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0060","text":"那样的话，今天\n没抢到票的人也能来看我们了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0070","text":"……！\n是啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0080","text":"……所以今天，\n办一场精彩的演出吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0090","text":"不，是必须办到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500100_04_0100","text":"————走吧"}]
